    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Liking the taste",
     "texto": [
      "**Smakuje mi zupa** means «I like the soup» or «the soup tastes good to me».",
      "Polish uses the dative **mi** («to me»); in English we usually say «I like»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Singular and plural",
     "texto": [
      "**Smakuje** goes with a single dish; **smakują** agrees with a plural subject: **Pierogi mi smakują** («I like pierogi»).",
      "The pronoun **mi** does not change."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
